# Whoever owns these paths must approve any change to them (enable "Require review
# from Code Owners" on main). They are the things packages are JUDGED by: the tests,
# the tools that run them, the workflows, and the Harbour pin. An automated pull
# request cannot touch them at all (see tools/guard.py and the `guard` job in
# .github/workflows/pr.yml), so a change here is always a human's.
/tools/                  @aryamurray
/.github/                @aryamurray
/packages/*/test/        @aryamurray
/.harbour-version        @aryamurray
/CODEOWNERS              @aryamurray
/.gitattributes          @aryamurray
/config.toml             @aryamurray
